Follow AGENTS.md.

## Mandatory Completion Gate
No task, bugfix, or modification is considered "done" until all jobs in the CI pipeline pass locally (`scripts/verify-ci-local.sh` or `make verify-ci`). Agents MUST NOT consider any modification done, mark task checkboxes `[X]`, report completion to the user, or push to remote without running and passing this gate. The Stop hook in `.cursor/hooks.json` blocks completion if this gate fails.